==Russian==

===Etymology===
Prefix {{m|ru|при-||indicating action or motion towards a terminal point}} + {{m|ru|идти́||to walk or go}} + {{m|ru|-сь||reflexive}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|прийти́сь}}
* {{ru-IPA|phon=прийдти́сь|gem=y}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-прийтись.ogg}}
* {{ru-IPA|phon=прити́сь}}
* {{ru-IPA|phon=придти́сь|gem=y}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|прийти́сь|pf|impf=приходи́ться}}

# {{lb|ru|impersonal}} to [[be]] [[necessary]], to be [[require]]d {{+obj|ru|dat<for someone> + inf<to do something>}} {{q|idiomatically translated by {{m+|en|have to}} or {{m|en|must}} with the dative object as the subject}}
#: {{uxi|ru|нам '''пришло́сь''' [[уйти́]] [[бы́стро]]|we had to leave quickly|lit='''it was necessary''' for us to leave quickly}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[знать|знай]], [[прия́тель]]: [[е́сли]] [[я]] [[ты|тебе́]] [[этот|э́то]] [[сказать|скажу́]], [[я|мне]] '''придётся''' [[ты|тебя́]] [[уби́ть]]|listen, pal, if I tell you this, I’ll have to kill you}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[о]] [[этот|э́том]] [[дело|де́ле]] [[говори́ть]] [[не]] '''пришло́сь'''|there '''was''' no '''need''' to speak about this matter}}
# to [[fall]], to [[occur]] {{+obj|ru|:на(acc)<on a specific date>}}
# {{lb|ru|impersonal}} to [[be]] {{q|in a certain state}} {{+obj|ru|dat<for someone> + adverb<in a certain state>}} {{q|idiomatically translated by {{m+|en|to [[have]] a certain [[time]] of it}} with the dative object as the subject}}
#: {{uxi|ru|ему́ '''пришло́сь''' [[легко́]]|he has had an easy time of it}}
# to [[come]] from, to [[be]] [[constitute]]d by {{q|of a quantity}} {{+obj|ru|:на(acc)<a source>}} {{q|idiomatically translated by {{m+|en|account for}} with the object of {{m|ru|на}} as the subject}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[полови́на]] [[весь|всего́]] [[экспорт|э́кспорта]] '''пришла́сь''' [[на]] [[нефть]]|oil accounted for half of all exports|lit=one half of all exports '''came from''' oil}}
# {{lb|ru|impersonal}} to be [[due]] {{+obj|ru|:на(acc)<from someone> + :по(dat)<some amount>}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[на]] [[каждый|ка́ждого]] [[пассажир|пассажи́ра]] '''пришло́сь''' [[по]] [[рубль|рублю́]]|each passenger had to pay a ruble|lit=a ruble '''was due''' from each passenger}}
# {{lb|ru|imperfective only}} to be [[related]] {{+obj|ru|dat<to someone>}}
# to [[suit]], to [[fit]] {{q|usually in specific expressions}} {{+obj|ru|dat<someone> + :по(dat)<with respect to something>}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''прийти́сь''' [[по]] [[вкус|вку́су]]|to be to one's taste, to be to one's liking|lit=to '''suit''' one's taste}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''прийти́сь''' [[по]] [[душа|душе́]]|to be pleasing|lit=to '''suit''' one's spirit}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''прийти́сь''' [[кста́ти]]|to [[come in handy]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[туфля|ту́фли]] '''пришли́сь''' [[по]] [[нога|ноге́]]|the shoes fit well|q=in the past tense|lit=the shoes '''suited''' the foot}}
#: {{uxi|ru|нам '''пришёлся''' [[по]] [[душа|душе́]] э́тот автомоби́ль|we '''liked''' this car|lit=this car '''suited''' our spirit}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[этот|э́та]] [[вещь]] '''пришла́сь''' [[кста́ти]]|this thing came in handy}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|irreg|прийти́сь}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|прийти́}}, {{l|ru|приходи́ть}}
* {{l|ru|прихо́д}}, {{l|ru|прише́лец}}, {{l|ru|прише́ствие}}
* {{l|ru|при́шлый}}

